in how positive they felt receiving and compliment, in part because each one was unique. And when stuff is different, you don't adapt to that. Stays good all along. So you're someone who likes to, you know, walk the talk, and so you took this research finding back to your own family, and you proposed a new Christmas tradition. Tell me what the tradition was that you proposed and how it went down.

