00:31:54.000 --> 00:32:28.000
You once ran a study where you asked volunteers to send a gratitude letter to someone in their lives. I'm assuming, as in the previous examples, most people misperceived the effect this letter would have on the recipients. That's part of the thing too for me with Mr. Ani is that it's been so many years that reaching out, out of the blue just feels like it's gonna be weird. What often gets in the way is our concern or anxiety about how the other person might respond. What exactly will I

